    {
      "index": 1,
      "record_file_offset": 24,
      "speech": "I am Monad, voice of the Cosmic One. Thou\nhast come for judgment.  Thy sin is\ngreat! Thou hast committed a mighty crime\nat which the Cosmos blanches. Thou hast\ndestroyed the worlds of an entire alien\npeople, obliterating them from this\ncluster. As thy sin was great, so thy\npenitence shall be great and severe. Thy\ncolony is cursed. Now go, and sin no\nmore!",
      "speech_text_offset": 421,
      "choices": [
        {
          "result": 0,
